<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound overnight rates rise fractionally.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound overnight rates rise fractionally.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight rates on the Egyptian pound rose a fraction on Tuesday to between 8-3/4 and 9-1/8 percent from 8-1/2 and nine percent on Monday, bankers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The market is a bit short from yesterday,&quot; one banker said.</p>
<p>One-week rates also increased slightly to between 8-3/4 and nine percent, compared to 8-1/2 and nine percent on Monday, bankers said.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
